  "translations": {
    "translations": [
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://asianwiki.com/Shoutai_(Japanese_Movie)",
          "overview": "Kaburagi was arrested as a suspect in a brutal murder case, but he escapes. He continues to hide and move all around Japan. During this time, he meets Sayaka, Kazuya and Mai. Detective Matanuki is on the trail to capture Kaburagi. He interrogates the people who met Kaburagi, but they all describe Kaburagi differently from each other. Kaburagi has been missing for 488 days. Who really is Kaburagi? What is his plan?",
          "runtime": 120,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Faceless"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "BR",
        "iso_639_1": "pt",
        "name": "Português",
        "english_name": "Portuguese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Kaburagi (Ryusei Yokohama) foi preso como suspeito em um caso de assassinato brutal, mas ele escapa. Ele continua a se esconder e se mover por todo o Japão. Durante esse tempo, ele conhece Sayaka (Riho Yoshioka), Kazuya (Shintaro Morimoto) e Mai (Anna Yamada). O detetive Matanuki (Takayuki Yamada) está na trilha para capturar Kaburagi. Ele interroga as pessoas que conheceram Kaburagi, mas todas descrevem Kaburagi de maneira diferente umas das outras. Kaburagi está desaparecido há 488 dias. Quem realmente é Kaburagi? Qual é o seu plano?",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Verdadeira Identidade"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TW",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "東京清晨不平靜。多年前東村山一家慘遭血洗，連五歲孩童都不放過，十八歲的現行犯鏑木慶一當場被逮捕，死刑定讞，坐牢數年卻突然脫逃，令日本全境人人自危。一百一十八天後，喬裝成工人的他於大阪工地被目擊，兩個月過去，又在東京被指認是雜誌自由撰稿者。目擊證人口中的鏑木各具形象、性格迥異。究竟哪個才是真正的他？為何藏匿大阪卻又折返東京？",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "正體"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "JP",
        "iso_639_1": "ja",
        "name": "日本語",
        "english_name": "Japanese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "染井為人による同名小説を「ヴィレッジ」の藤井道人監督、横浜流星主演で映画化。殺人事件の容疑者として逮捕された鏑木が脱走した。又貫刑事は、潜伏し逃走を続ける鏑木と各地で出会った沙耶香らを取り調べるが、それぞれ出会った鏑木はまったく別人の姿であった。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "信じる、君を。この世界を。",
          "title": "正体"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TH",
        "iso_639_1": "th",
        "name": "ภาษาไทย",
        "english_name": "Thai",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "เมื่อคาบูรากิซึ่งเป็นนักโทษหลบหนี เจ้าหน้าที่จึงตามไล่ล่าตัวอย่างสิ้นหวังไปทั่วญี่ปุ่น แต่นักข่าวจากโตเกียวจะช่วยอาชญากรผู้นี้ล้างมลทินได้ไหม",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "ไร้หน้า"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "KR",
        "iso_639_1": "ko",
        "name": "한국어/조선말",
        "english_name": "Korean",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "탈주범 가부라기가 경찰의 추적을 피해 일본 각지를 누비며 필사의 도주를 한다. 결백을 증명하려는 가부라기에게 도쿄의 한 저널리스트가 희망의 빛이 되어 줄 수 있을까?",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "정체"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Adaptation cinématographique du roman Shoutai de Tamehito Somei. Principal suspect dans une affaire de meurtre sordide, Keiichi Kaburagi prend la fuite lors de son transfert vers la prison. En cavale, il se cache aux quatre coins du Japon, brouillant habilement les pistes pour semer les enquêteurs à sa poursuite.",
          "runtime": 120,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Shoutai"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "本片改编自同名小说，讲述了镝木庆一作为一对夫妇被杀的杀人事件的嫌疑犯被捕，被判处死刑。他在移送过程中逃脱。镝木越狱的消息在电视等媒体上被大肆报道，警方虽然全力追查镝木的行踪，但仍未能抓到他。另一方面，事件受害者夫妇中丈夫的母亲井尾由子患有痴呆症，受到了事件的创伤，仍在护理机构进行疗养。镝木一边逃跑一边在躲藏的地方改变了名字和样子，他与施工现场的工作人员野野村和也等许多人相遇，并将他们从困境中解救出来。当野野村他们发现镝木是通缉中的死刑犯时，对于“他真的是杀人犯吗？”开始产生疑问。",
          "runtime": 120,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "正体"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "ES",
        "iso_639_1": "es",
        "name": "Español",
        "english_name": "Spanish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Kaburagi fue arrestado como sospechoso de un brutal asesinato, pero logró escapar. Continúa ocultándose y recorriendo todo Japón. Durante este tiempo, conoce a Sayaka, Kazuya y Mai. El detective Matanuki está tras la pista para capturar a Kaburagi. Interroga a quienes lo conocieron, pero todos lo describen de forma diferente. Kaburagi lleva 488 días desaparecido. ¿Quién es realmente Kaburagi? ¿Cuál es su plan?",
          "runtime": 120,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Shotai"
        }
